          "filename": "Building Destroyed (4007949020).jpg",
          "caption": "A toppled chair lay in front of the ruins of the Ambacang Hotel. The Dutch-era colonial style hotel is located in downtown Padang. The modernized section of the Ambacang Hotel is totally destroyed by the 2009 quake. Rescue efforts are still in progress. it is estimated that around 200 hotel guest have not been evacuated. Padang, West Sumatra. October 7, 2009",
          "alt": "A toppled chair lay in front of the ruins of the Ambacang Hotel. The Dutch-era colonial style hotel is located in downtown Padang. The modernized section of the Ambacang Hotel is totally destroyed by the 2009 quake. Rescue efforts are still in progress. it is estimated that around 200 hotel guest have not been evacuated. Padang, West Sumatra. October 7, 2009",
          "width": 2336,
          "height": 3504,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "Public domain",
          "artist": "USAID Indonesia",
          "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Building_Destroyed_(4007949020).jpg",
