        {
          "path": "_m/q/p/z/5/2009-sumatra-earthquakes-wp/building-destroyed-4007944324.jpg",
          "filename": "Building Destroyed (4007944324).jpg",
          "caption": "Chairs lay outside class rooms at the Agnes elementary Catholic school. The front section of building, which functions as classrooms, collapsed during the 2009 Padang earthquake. The school was founded in 1 May 1900. it is located in Jalan Bundo Kanduang, Padang, West Sumatra.  October 7, 2009",
          "alt": "Chairs lay outside class rooms at the Agnes elementary Catholic school. The front section of building, which functions as classrooms, collapsed during the 2009 Padang earthquake. The school was founded in 1 May 1900. it is located in Jalan Bundo Kanduang, Padang, West Sumatra.  October 7, 2009",
